  "description": "After creating the song that could catapult his band into further success, Alex (leader of the band Noir Bril) wakes up to find his unconscious body bludgeoned on the ground. Stuck in between the worlds of the living and the dead, Alex is running out of time before his chance to return to the living world is gone forever. Desperate to return to his body, he is lead to a medium named Sasha. All Sasha wants is to finally live a life far away from the supernatural world that surrounds her. But, her plans take a turn as soon as Alex comes along.\n\n- Webtoons",
